Chapter: BvtSpellSounds
  cites Uoaix chapter MageryActions
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 UOAIX-170: each stat spell plays its own ServUO sound, and Fireball and Explosion play sounds the 1998 client holds
 (0x15E, 0x207) rather than 0x44B and 0x307, which its SOUNDIDX.MUL lacks.
  bspl-mob : Integer -> WorldObject
  bspl-mob (serial) = WorldObject { serial = serial, kind = 1, x = 1440, y = 1700, z = 0, graphic = #190, hue = 0, container = 0, amount = 1, health = 50 }
 A 0x54 sound packet carries its sound id big-endian at bytes 2 and 3.
  bspl-sound : List (List Integer) -> Integer
  bspl-sound (shown) = let p = list-at shown (list-length shown - 1) in if list-at p 0 /= #54 then 0 - 1 else list-at p 2 * 256 + list-at p 3
  bvt-spell-sounds : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-spell-sounds (unused) = let a = bspl-mob 9001 in let b = bspl-mob 9002 in act
    x <- bvt-check "Clumsy, Feeblemind and Weaken sound 0x1DF; Agility 0x1E7, Cunning 0x1EB, Strength 0x1EE, Bless 0x1EA, Curse 0x1E1 (mga-stat-sound)" (mga-stat-sound 1 == #01DF & mga-stat-sound 3 == #01DF & mga-stat-sound 8 == #01DF & mga-stat-sound 9 == #01E7 & mga-stat-sound 10 == #01EB & mga-stat-sound 16 == #01EE & mga-stat-sound 17 == #01EA & mga-stat-sound 27 == #01E1)
    y <- bvt-check "Fireball sounds 0x15E and Explosion 0x207, never the 0x44B and 0x307 the 1998 client lacks; Magic Arrow keeps 0x1E5 (mga-damage-show)" (bspl-sound (mga-damage-show a b 18) == #015E & bspl-sound (mga-damage-show a b 43) == #0207 & bspl-sound (mga-damage-show a b 5) == #01E5)
    z <- bvt-check "stat spells show ServUO's effects: Clumsy, Feeblemind, Weaken 0x3779; Agility, Cunning, Strength 0x375A; Bless 0x373A; Curse 0x374A (mga-stat-effect)" (mga-stat-effect 1 == #3779 & mga-stat-effect 3 == #3779 & mga-stat-effect 8 == #3779 & mga-stat-effect 9 == #375A & mga-stat-effect 10 == #375A & mga-stat-effect 16 == #375A & mga-stat-effect 17 == #373A & mga-stat-effect 27 == #374A)
    w <- bvt-check "Recall drops only the 0x70 flashes from a travel reply and keeps the move and the sound (mga-unflash)" (mga-unflash [[#70, 0], [#20, 1], [#70, 3], [#54, 1]] 0 [] == [[#20, 1], [#54, 1]] & mga-unflash [[], [#54, 1]] 0 [] == [[], [#54, 1]])
    v <- bvt-check "Incognito sounds 0x20F, Polymorph's, never the 0x3BD the 1998 client lacks (mga-incognito-sound, UOAIX-170)" (mga-incognito-sound == #020F & mga-incognito-sound /= #03BD)
    x + y + z + w + v
  end
